## Server: `ansible` (Red Hat ADT)

| Tool | When to use |
|---|---|
| `ansible_lint` | After editing any playbook or role task file |
| `ansible_navigator` | Running playbooks end-to-end |
| `ade_environment_info` | Checking installed collections, Python, Ansible versions |
| `ade_setup_environment` | Setting up or repairing the dev environment |
| `define_and_build_execution_env` | Building execution environment images |
