## Tool Priority (when servers overlap)

When multiple servers offer the same capability, use in this order:
1. `ansible-mcp` — project-aware, uses registered inventory and config
2. `ansible` (Red Hat ADT) — dev tooling, linting, environment management
3. `sysoperator` — use for unique tools (`list_tasks`, `terraform`, AWS) or as fallback

